    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Process and result",
     "texto": [
      "**Czytałam książkę** means «I was reading a book»; the imperfective form focuses on the activity.",
      "**Przeczytałam książkę** means «I read the whole book»; the perfective form presents the result."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Other pairs",
     "texto": [
      "**Oglądać** describes the process of watching a film; **obejrzeć** presents the film as watched to the end.",
      "English often uses «watched» for both ideas; in Polish the aspect changes the verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
